## About Zscaler

Zscaler (NASDAQ: ZS) operates the Zero Trust Exchange, the world’s largest cloud native, single vendor Secure Access Service Edge (SASE) platform. It provides AI-augmented inline cloud security that securely connects users, devices, and workloads over any network. Zscaler replaces legacy network architectures to minimize the corporate attack surface, eliminate lateral threat movement, and secure enterprise AI adoption.

